{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116923","id":3340580205,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HHTVt","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116923","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116923.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116923.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116923","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116923/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116923/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116923/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fac2499d357fb38f6131c01ad79d1833cdfe1788","number":116923,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change loop override text for AudioStreamMP3 and AudioStreamOggVorbis","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#setting-up-a-dev-environment\r\n-->\r\nCloses: #96194\r\n(maybe)\r\nRelated to: #96200\r\n\r\nThe first checkbox is the `looping_override` bool. If checked, the checkbox next to it in the UI is what decides whether or not the audio will loop or not, instead of the import `loop`. This one is `looping` in code.\r\n\r\nThis shouldn't break compatibility, since this parameter has no setter/getter.\r\nRemoving the first checkbox (`looping_override`) may sound like a reasonable solution, but it breaks compatibility.\r\n\r\nSee, I'd have changed the \"change\" in the title to \"clarify\". The problem is, I cannot find how to change the tooltip text for that paremeter, which could actually help clarify why there are two checkboxes.\r\nThis parameter is not documented, which means I can't just change its description. And I'm not sure if I could add it to the docs, since it does not have a setter/getter. Adding those to code could probably significantly increase the scope of this fix.\r\nI could not find any examples in code of Parameters with tooltips. So just calling it \"Loop Override\" is the best I could do for now. I hope it clarifies at least a little what that checkbox does.\r\n\r\nTested, works on my end.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api